### Get businesses
GET http://localhost:8080/businesses

### Get one business
GET http://localhost:8080/businesses/27

### Create business
POST http://localhost:8080/businesses
Content-Type: application/json

{
          "name":"f",
          "address":"3643 Reisterstown Rd",
          "city":"Baltimore",
          "state":"MD",
          "zipCode":"21215",
          "phone":"301-775-1235",
          "email":"shabsis@@@@hotmail.com",
          "description":"abc defg",
          "ownerId": 53
}


### Update business
PUT http://localhost:8080/businesses/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
          "name":"Seven Mile Market",
          "address":"4000 Reisterstown Rd",
          "city":"Baltimore",
          "state":"MD",
          "zipCode":"21208",
          "phone":"301-775-1235",
          "email":"7milemarket@gmail.com",
          "description":"Adios Amigos!",
          "owner": { "id":42 }
}

